# Reading a mural or a tablet (week 35). Pages come from Reading
# (src/dialogue/reading.gd); the text is made by Lore from the event log.

~ start
{{title}}: {{page(0)}}
if count > 1
	{{title}}: {{page(1)}}
if count > 2
	{{title}}: {{page(2)}}
if count > 3
	{{title}}: {{page(3)}}
if count > 4
	{{title}}: {{page(4)}}
if count > 5
	{{title}}: {{page(5)}}
=> END
